builtin_interfaces/Time stamp
hardware_msgs/ActuatorCommand[] commands

================================================================================
MSG: builtin_interfaces/Time
# This message communicates ROS Time defined here:
# https://design.ros2.org/articles/clock_and_time.html

# The seconds component, valid over all int32 values.
int32 sec

# The nanoseconds component, valid in the range [0, 10e9).
uint32 nanosec

================================================================================
MSG: hardware_msgs/ActuatorCommand
uint8 id
bool enable
uint8 control_mode
float64 position_target     # rad
float64 velocity_target     # rad/s
float64 torque_target       # Nm
float64 kp                  # Nm/rad
float64 kd                  # Nm*s/rad
float64 torque_feed_forward # Nm
float64 velocity_limit      # rad/s
float64 acceleration_limit  # rad/s^2
